            <ArticleTitle>[Segmental testicular infarction. Unusual complication of intravenous immunoglobulin therapy for multifocal motor neuropathy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1421-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s00120-015-3941-x</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe the previously unknown case of segmental testicular infarction as an iatrogenic complication of intravenous immunoglobulin administration in a patient with multifocal motor neuropathy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
